---@field mimeType? string An IANA published [media type (MIME type)](https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml).
---@field textStyles? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3DocumentStyleList Styles for the Document.text.
