---@field textChanges? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3DocumentTextChangeList Placeholder. A list of text corrections made to Document.text. This is usually used for annotating corrections to OCR mistakes. Text changes for a given revision may not overlap with each other.
