---@field addressValue? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleTypePostalAddress Postal address. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/postal_address.proto
---@field booleanValue? boolean Boolean value. Can be used for entities with binary values, or for checkboxes.
---@field dateValue? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleTypeDate Date value. Includes year, month, day. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/date.proto
---@field integerValue? number Integer value.
---@field floatValue? number Float value.

