---Font and other text style attributes.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3DocumentPageTokenStyleInfo
---@field underlined? boolean Whether the text is underlined.
---@field fontType? string Name or style of the font.
---@field strikeout? boolean Whether the text is strikethrough. This feature is not supported yet.
---@field backgroundColor? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleTypeColor Color of the background.
---@field pixelFontSize? number Font size in pixels, equal to _unrounded font_size_ * _resolution_ ÷ `72.0`.
---@field superscript? boolean Whether the text is a superscript. This feature is not supported yet.
