---@field bold? boolean Whether the text is bold (equivalent to font_weight is at least `700`).
---@field fontSize? number Font size in points (`1` point is `¹⁄₇₂` inches).
---@field textColor? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleTypeColor Color of the text.
---@field letterSpacing? number Letter spacing in points.

