---Config for Document OCR.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfig
---@field disableCharacterBoxesDetection? boolean Turn off character box detector in OCR engine. Character box detection is enabled by default in OCR 2.0 (and later) processors.
---@field hints? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfigHints Hints for the OCR model.
---@field enableNativePdfParsing? boolean Enables special handling for PDFs with existing text information. Results in better text extraction quality in such PDF inputs.
---@field enableSymbol? boolean Includes symbol level OCR information if set to true.
---@field premiumFeatures? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfigPremiumFeatures Configurations for premium OCR features.
---@field computeStyleInfo? boolean Turn on font identification model and return font style information. Deprecated, use PremiumFeatures.compute_style_info instead.
---@field advancedOcrOptions? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.StringList A list of advanced OCR options to further fine-tune OCR behavior. Current valid values are: - `legacy_layout`: a heuristics layout detection algorithm, which serves as an alternative to the current ML-based layout detection algorithm. Customers can choose the best suitable layout algorithm based on their situation.
---@field enableImageQualityScores? boolean Enables intelligent document quality scores after OCR. Can help with diagnosing why OCR responses are of poor quality for a given input. Adds additional latency comparable to regular OCR to the process call.

---Hints for OCR Engine
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfigHints
---@field languageHints? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.StringList List of BCP-47 language codes to use for OCR. In most cases, not specifying it yields the best results since it enables automatic language detection. For languages based on the Latin alphabet, setting hints is not needed. In rare cases, when the language of the text in the image is known, setting a hint will help get better results (although it will be a significant hindrance if the hint is wrong).

---Configurations for premium OCR features.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfigPremiumFeatures
---@field enableSelectionMarkDetection? boolean Turn on selection mark detector in OCR engine. Only available in OCR 2.0 (and later) processors.
---@field enableMathOcr? boolean Turn on the model that can extract LaTeX math formulas.
---@field computeStyleInfo? boolean Turn on font identification model and return font style information.

---Options for Process API
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptions
---@field fromEnd? number Only process certain pages from the end, same as above.
---@field layoutConfig? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsLayoutConfig Optional. Only applicable to `LAYOUT_PARSER_PROCESSOR`. Returns error if set on other processor types.
---@field ocrConfig? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3OcrConfig Only applicable to `OCR_PROCESSOR` and `FORM_PARSER_PROCESSOR`. Returns error if set on other processor types.
---@field individualPageSelector? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsIndividualPageSelector Which pages to process (1-indexed).
---@field schemaOverride? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3DocumentSchema Optional. Override the schema of the ProcessorVersion. Will return an Invalid Argument error if this field is set when the underlying ProcessorVersion doesn't support schema override.
---@field fromStart? number Only process certain pages from the start. Process all if the document has fewer pages.

---A list of individual page numbers.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsIndividualPageSelector
---@field pages? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.IntegerList Optional. Indices of the pages (starting from 1).

---Serving config for layout parser processor.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsLayoutConfig
---@field returnBoundingBoxes? boolean Optional. Whether to include bounding boxes in layout parser processor response.
---@field enableLlmLayoutParsing? boolean Optional. Whether to refine PDF layout using LLM.
---@field enableImageAnnotation? boolean Optional. Whether to include image annotations in layout parser response.
---@field chunkingConfig? gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsLayoutConfigChunkingConfig Optional. Config for chunking in layout parser processor.
---@field returnImages? boolean Optional. Whether to include images in layout parser processor response.
---@field enableTableSplit? boolean Optional. Whether to split table.
---@field enableImageExtraction? boolean Optional. Whether to extract images in layout parser response.
---@field enableTableAnnotation? boolean Optional. Whether to include table annotations in layout parser response.

---Serving config for chunking.
---@class gcp.unstable.documentai_v1beta3.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1beta3ProcessOptionsLayoutConfigChunkingConfig
---@field chunkSize? number Optional. The chunk sizes to use when splitting documents, in order of level.
---@field breakpointPercentileThreshold? number Optional. The percentile of cosine dissimilarity that must be exceeded between a group of tokens and the next. The smaller this number is, the more chunks will be generated. **Note:** This field is not yet used.
---@field semanticChunkingGroupSize? boolean Optional. The number of tokens to group together when evaluating semantic similarity. **Note:** This field is not yet used.
---@field includeAncestorHeadings? boolean Optional. Whether or not to include ancestor headings when splitting.

